{"summary":"Heal is an abstract 2D puzzle-adventure point-and-click game.","description":"Guide an old man through the dark and atmospheric world of Heal in this abstract 2D puzzle-adventure point-and-click game.\n\nDear, I'm playing our melody for you.\nDo you find it familiar...?\nMaybe it could help you to remember.\n... to remember us.\n\nI want to see you again, even if only for one last time.\n\n______________________________\n\nHeal is an experimental adventure game from the creator of DISTRAINT -series.\n\nThere are very little dialogue and text in Heal. Instead, the narrative is driven by a strong and obscure atmosphere. \n\n* Side-scrolling 2D with unique, handmade graphics\n* Atmospheric sound design\n* An abstract world filled with puzzles\n* Narrative driven by the atmosphere\n* Handmade in Finland - no asset flips or cheap tricks!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":"Horror","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dr0xiEYEfiw?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J5jd2ggrr8Uf4Vw5l0HKbaixkhw73v5hLJqKCRTzZyLIKIH_wNpV0xMmjOm7PnS7q0anO2HMSbT4-bKY2JTAvA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fWe3ANneCwHbScO9HBEXt1sAt-_VIjwNUHgYm-REgU9HtSdJTEJi1LG-T4xPkGtonrXbS58SSBlab2B1NTpbbA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/856KTwI-NFduNorE54HNgtfXhP0TdOzqKrmaXYQ1FVaBWofdd34ZrtwtcqG99EXryM1b7C1iyvq_a7JTLq-aaWY","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pInql48i293cONbNYruGkDihbfRPuo9mZyVuT8JxfJp0gPno7orf1wtf9awdy3CRKikaooLsoK0JHL5L7HQUbA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7R-UqfMxUPV8YtnO9Kut_e34l119k6aWEzCdZY_eeEjg_nTmjsuFSZE3gKNrkxY9mg3DSIC_GxbniZgmNwvL4A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7_ecRW3Q0sUUZnS0jEo_zHhs7ttB-ExxezNcJdS_k0XgWiEL0GTw_Bc38FwAr6dhVQlneThOvyLu_HYj4ZRpgw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WXQx8Z0tosjT5EDWX9r9N-4LDhDlKNWGIo5Iz1u1OQ6BB-uhL4hp2kGR7wTXzq2Bh9KU4uZOCWOakpWcXmAI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ND-A5wz-kWGqJaqrN3Rc1Zj781rhpdyyPi1lhT8v4TbHwnB